{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05819","headline":"酬诸公见过 · 王维","name":"酬诸公见过","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"嗟予未丧，哀此孤生。\n屏居蓝田，薄地躬耕。\n岁[晏]输税，以奉粢盛。\n晨往东臯，草露未曦。\n暮看烟火，负担来归。\n我闻有客，足埽荆扉。\n箪食伊何，疈瓜抓枣。\n仰厕羣贤，皤然一老。\n媿无莞簟，班荆席藁。\n泛泛登陂，折彼荷花。\n静观素鲔，俯映白沙。\n山鸟羣飞，日隐轻霞。\n登车上马，倏忽云散。\n雀噪荒村，鸡鸣空馆。\n还复幽独，重欷累叹。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王维","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05819.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05819","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}